  "title": "Oyster and Cornbread Dressing",
  "description": "Each year I am asked to make this wonderful dressing. The recipe has been in my family for years. Chopped oysters and chicken broth make it very moist and flavorful. For an even more moist dressing, use more chicken broth.",
  "authors": [
    "DUNCANS FAVORITES"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-02T10:31:06-04:00",
